  "body_html": "<p>By <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+MadsStoumannDK?rel=author\">Mads Stoumann</a></p>\n<p>Have you ever tried to pick your country from a drop-down on a mobile phone?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://madsstoumann.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/datalist.png\"><img src=\"https://madsstoumann.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/datalist.png?w=297&h=147\" alt=\"datalist\" width=\"297\" height=\"147\" /></a></p>\n<p>HTML5 introduced a new element, the &lt;datalist&gt;, which is a nice, fast and JavaScript-free autosuggest.</p>\n<p>Happy coding!</p>",
